	(text "EastRising ER-TFT035IPS-6 (ILI9488, 4-wire SPI); its 50-pin FPC folds under the panel into J3 (ZIF). J3 pin j is panel pin 51 - j."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 83.1545 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "02c32759-1bbc-52fd-8933-b8791b1e93cb")
	)
	(text "Unused bus pins as the datasheet says: DB0-17 and RGB low, RD and IM2-0 high. Backlight: LED_A on VSYS; a current sink per"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 81.2857 179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d67e503a-936d-5f9b-84aa-480b7d9bd3de")
	)
	(text "cathode pin (U6 half, Q5/Q6, 2.2 ohm R52/R53). GPIO44 PWM, filtered by R60/R61/C50, sets BL_REF: 0.124 V (56 mA a pin)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 80.311 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "258e1e98-1eaf-5c81-abc9-b63822cb370b")
	)
	(text "at 100%. Stability: sim/backlight.py. JP2 and JP4: cut to measure the LED or panel logic current."
